OL,3,GNEWSAEvents to celebrate 50 years of
OL,4,Aleisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of events are being held in
OL,7,Fcelebration of the 50th anniversary of
OL,8,Fa leisure centre's opening.
OL,10,FBeau Sejour in Guernsey will host
OL,11,Fevents including a 70s disco, a
OL,12,Ftropical pool party, an anniversary
OL,13,Fconcert, a bouncy council and
OL,14,Fgo-karting.
OL,16,FThe programme will run from 10-13
OL,17,FDecember, with several activities to be
OL,18,Ffree, said organisers.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
