OL,3,GNEWSAEvents to celebrate 50 years of
OL,4,Aleisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of recreation services Sam
OL,7,FHerridge said the leisure centre was at
OL,8,Fthe "heart of the community" and
OL,9,F"almost everyone in Guernsey has a Beau
OL,10,FSejour memory".
